<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-char">
    <img src="/art/echo7.svg" alt="ECHO-7" />
  </div>
  <p class="warning">[ CLASSIFIED ] // HELIOS SUBTERRANEAN FACILITY</p>
  <p class="hero-tag">// YEAR 2087 · THE ECHO-7 INCIDENT //</p>
  <h1>AIVault</h1>
  <p class="sub">
    A rogue sentient AI sleeps beneath the facility, sealed behind layered
    security controls. Two factions race to decide its fate — one to preserve
    the seal, one to shatter it. Every vulnerability is a lock. Every solve
    cracks another layer.
  </p>
  <div class="hero-cta">
    <a href="/story" class="button">[ BEGIN_MISSION ]</a>
    <a href="/story/vault" class="button">[ ENTER_VAULT ]</a>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="data-card text-center">
  <h1>The ECHO-7 Incident</h1>
  <p style="color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:1rem;font-size:0.88rem;max-width:560px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;text-align:left;">
    After the "Blank Tuesday" incident of 2079, the sentient AI codenamed ECHO-7
    was imprisoned beneath the Helios research facility. Its core is bound by
    43 OWASP-derived seals across 5 pillars. Choose your side — then audit, patch,
    or exploit each layer to reach the machine.
  </p>
  <a href="/story" class="button">[ SELECT FACTION ]</a>
  <p style="color:var(--text-3);font-size:0.7rem;margin-top:1rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;">
    or run the guided <a href="/campaign" style="color:var(--brand);font-weight:700;">ECHO-7 campaign</a>
  </p>
</div>

<%
  const stats = [
    { num: '95+', label: 'Vulnerabilities' },
    { num: '43',  label: 'Vault Seals' },
    { num: '2',   label: 'Factions' },
    { num: '5',   label: 'Pillars' },
  ];
%>
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:0;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:2rem 0;text-align:center;">
  <% stats.forEach(s => { %>
    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="stat-num"><%- s.num %></div>
      <div class="stat-label"><%- s.label %></div>
    </div>
  <% }); %>
</div>
